### Sin presetId: el preset se resuelve por assignment segun el contexto
POST {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/render/{{tenantId}}
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "reportId": "{{reportId}}",
  "context": {
    "culture": "es-ES",
    "contextType": "cliente",
    "contextKey": "002532"
  },
  "output": {
    "format": "Html"
  },
  "data": {
    "factura": "060098"
  }
}

### Ver el documento (es la url que devuelve el render)
GET {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/documents/{{tenantId}}/f3ad6d5120f84c3cbd3ad4922bd039b0
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Descargarlo con su nombre de fichero
GET {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/documents/{{tenantId}}/REEMPLAZA_DOCUMENT_ID/download
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Metadatos, sin el contenido
GET {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/documents/{{tenantId}}/REEMPLAZA_DOCUMENT_ID/metadata
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Accept: application/json

###


### ==========================================================
### Bundles: varios documentos detrás de un único enlace
### ==========================================================

@bundleId = pega-aqui-el-bundleId

### Crear un bundle con documentos ya emitidos y uno que se emite ahora
# Cada elemento lleva "documentId" (ya emitido con /api/render) o "render"
# (misma petición que /api/render, se emite en esta llamada). La respuesta
# trae "url": es el enlace para el cliente y sólo se devuelve aquí, porque
# el token no se guarda en claro.
POST {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/bundles/{{tenantId}}
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Envío pedido 4512 - Gestamp Esmar",
  "message": "Adjuntamos la documentación del envío.\nCualquier duda, responde a este correo.",
  "expiresInDays": 15,
  "items": [
    {
      "documentId": "pega-aqui-un-documentId",
      "displayName": "Factura F-2026-0412"
    },
    {
      "displayName": "Albarán ALB_CON_PIT",
      "render": {
        "reportId": "{{reportId}}",
        "presetId": "{{presetId}}",
        "context": { "culture": "es-ES" },
        "output": { "fileName": "albaran-ALB_CON_PIT.html" },
        "data": {
          "deliveryNote": { "number": "ALB_CON_PIT", "date": "2026-09-15" },
          "customer": { "code": "001184", "name": "Gestamp Esmar S.A.U." },
          "materials": []
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}

### Últimos bundles del tenant
GET {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/bundles/{{tenantId}}?take=20
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Estado de un bundle (accesos, caducidad, documentos)
GET {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/bundles/{{tenantId}}/{{bundleId}}
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Enlace nuevo (el anterior deja de valer)
POST {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/bundles/{{tenantId}}/{{bundleId}}/link
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "expiresInDays": 30
}

### Revocar el enlace
POST {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/bundles/{{tenantId}}/{{bundleId}}/revoke
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}


### ==========================================================
### Filas planas: el resultado del SELECT tal cual
### (requiere el mapping guardado en Reports → Datos)
### ==========================================================

### Mapping asignado al report
GET {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/mappings/{{tenantId}}?reportId=packing-list-2026
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Probar las filas sin emitir documento: devuelve el JSON que se usaría
POST {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/mappings/{{tenantId}}/packing-list-2026-rows/preview
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rows": {
    "columns": [
      { "name": "SalidaId", "type": "Number" },
      { "name": "Nombre" },
      { "name": "AlbaranEjercicio" },
      { "name": "Referencia" },
      { "name": "Jaula" },
      { "name": "Articulo" },
      { "name": "Sinonimo" },
      { "name": "Descripcion_esp" },
      { "name": "Cantidad", "type": "Number" }
    ],
    "rows": [
      [3116, "Inter Cars, S.A.", "001963/2026", "7th", "PAL235071 ", "00119012.A2", "6504-04-6621312Q", "Aleta Del. D. Seat-Ibiza 2008", 16],
      [3116, "Inter Cars, S.A.", "001963/2026", "7th", "PAL235072 ", "00158011.A2", "6504-04-6614311Q", "Aleta Del. I. Seat-Leon 2012", 8]
    ]
  }
}

### Emitir el packing list con filas (sin mappingId: el del report)
POST {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/render/{{tenantId}}
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reportId": "packing-list-2026",
  "rows": {
    "columns": [
      { "name": "SalidaId", "type": "Number" },
      { "name": "Nombre" },
      { "name": "AlbaranEjercicio" },
      { "name": "Referencia" },
      { "name": "Jaula" },
      { "name": "Articulo" },
      { "name": "Sinonimo" },
      { "name": "Descripcion_esp" },
      { "name": "Cantidad", "type": "Number" }
    ],
    "rows": [
      [3116, "Inter Cars, S.A.", "001963/2026", "7th", "PAL235071 ", "00119012.A2", "6504-04-6621312Q", "Aleta Del. D. Seat-Ibiza 2008", 16],
      [3116, "Inter Cars, S.A.", "001963/2026", "7th", "PAL235072 ", "00158011.A2", "6504-04-6614311Q", "Aleta Del. I. Seat-Leon 2012", 8]
    ]
  },
  "context": { "culture": "en-GB" },
  "output": { "format": "Pdf" }
}


### ==========================================================
### Fichero directo y validación
### ==========================================================

### Emitir y recibir el PDF en la misma respuesta
### (id del documento en la cabecera X-Renderset-Document-Id)
POST {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/render/{{tenantId}}/file
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reportId": "{{reportId}}",
  "context": { "culture": "es-ES" },
  "output": { "format": "Pdf" },
  "data": { "salida": "3128" }
}

### Validar sin emitir: { valid, reportId, presetId, presetVersion, errors }
POST {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/render/{{tenantId}}/validate
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reportId": "{{reportId}}",
  "data": { "salida": "10001" }
}

### Documento OpenAPI (sólo en desarrollo)
GET {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
